    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/b490784e-7d38-4faa-8cc2-db9a06e6a7da.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.15347in;height:1.45347in\" /><br />Slope of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BI</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Slope of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />Let, the slopes of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> are <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mr